JP-27_type:landmark|name=Ame no Mikumari Toyoura no Mikoto Shrine}}) ; Kokushi Genzaisha :* {{ill|Aki Province|ja|安芸国}}: Mikumari Tenjin :''' Identified as: {{ill|Mikumari Shrine (Fuchu, Hiroshima)|ja|水分神社}} ({{ill|Fuchu, Hiroshima|ja|府中町}}, {{Coord|34|24|35.12|N|132|31|9.28|E|region:JP-34_type:landmark|name=Mikumari Shrine}}).<ref>[http://www2.town.fuchu.hiroshima.jp/www/contents/1352247926063/index.html Mikumari Shrine] (Fuchu Town Website).</ref>
