l|Settsu Province|ja|摂津国|12=draft}}, {{ill|Sumiyoshi District|ja|住吉郡|12=draft}}: Ame no Mikumari Toyoura no Mikoto Shrine :''' Identified as: Enshrined within {{ill|Totoro-hime Shrine|ja|止止呂支比売命神社|12=draft}} (Osaka, {{Coord|34|36|17.25|N|135|29|50.50|E|region:JP-27_type:landmark|name=Ame no Mikumari Toyoura no Mikoto Shrine}}) ; Kokushi Genzaisha :* {{ill|Aki Province|ja|安芸国|12=draft}}: Mikumari Tenjin :''' Identified as: {{ill|Mikumari Shrine (Fuchu, Hiroshima)|ja|水分神社|12=draft}} ({{ill|Fuchu, Hiroshima|ja|府中町|12=draft}}, {{Coord|34|24|35.12|N|132|31|9.28|E|region:JP-34_type:landmark|name=Mikumari Shrine}}).<ref>[http://www2.town.fuchu.hiroshima.jp/www/contents/1352247926063/index.html Mikumari Shrine] (Fuchu Town Website).</ref>
