{{Infobox deity|image=File:Udamikumari Shr Kami.jpg|script=水分神|name=Mikumari-no-Kami|script_name=Japanese|mother={{ill|Hayaakitsuhiko and Hayaakitsuhime|lt=Hayaakitsuhiko and Hayaakitsuhime|ja|ハヤアキツヒコ・ハヤアキツヒメ|en:draft|6=simple|7=User:Immanuelle/Hayaakitsuhiko and Hayaakitsuhime|8=fr|9=User:Immanuelle/Hayaakitsuhiko and Hayaakitsuhime|lt=Hayaakitsuhime}}|father={{ill|Hayaakitsuhiko and Hayaakitsuhime|lt=Hayaakitsuhiko and Hayaakitsuhime|ja|ハヤアキツヒコ・ハヤアキツヒメ|en:draft|6=simple|7=User:Immanuelle/Hayaakitsuhiko and Hayaakitsuhime|8=fr|9=User:Immanuelle/Hayaakitsuhiko and Hayaakitsuhime|lt=Hayaakitsuhiko}}|temples={{ill|Kono Shrine|en|Kono Shrine|fr|Kono-jinja|ja|籠神社|simple|user:immanuelle/Kono Shrine}}
{{ill|Uda Mikumari Shrine|en}} 
{{ill|Yoshino Mikumari Shrine|en}}
{{ill|Katsuragi Mikumari Shrine|ja|葛木水分神社}}
