ine|ja|都祁水分神社|qq=draft|12=simple|13=User:Immanuelle/Tsuge Mikumari Shrine|qq=|12=simple|13=User:Immanuelle/Tsuge Mikumari Shrine|qq=|12=simple|13=User:Immanuelle/Tsuge Mikumari Shrine|qq=}} ([[:en:Nara (city)|Nara, Nara]], {{Coord|34|35|49.98|N|135|56|50.00|E|region:JP-29_type:landmark|name=Tsuge Mikumari Shrine}}) :* [[:en:Kawachi Province|Kawachi Province]], [[:en:Ishikawa District, Fukushima|Ishikawa District (Osaka)]]: Tate Mikumari Shrine :''' Identified as: {{ill|Tate Mikumari Shrine|ja|建水分神社|1=Take Mikumari Shrine|qq=draft|12=simple|13=User:Immanuelle/Tate Mikumari Shrine|13=User:Immanuelle/Take Mikumari Shrine|qq=|12=simple|13=User:Immanuelle/Tate Mikumari Shrine|13=User:Immanuelle/Take Mikumari Shrine|qq=|12=simple|13=User:Immanuelle/Tate Mikumari Shrine|13=User:Immanuelle/Take Mikumari Shrine|qq=}} ([[:en:Chihayaakasaka|Chihayaakasaka, Osaka]], {{Coord|34|27|37.26|N|135|37|55.38|E|region:JP-27_type:landmark|name=Tate Mikumari Shrine}}) :* [[:en:Settsu Province|Settsu Province]], {{ill|Sumiyoshi District|ja|住吉郡|qq=draft|12=simple|13=User:Immanuelle/Sumiyoshi District|qq=|12=simple|13=User:Immanuelle/Sumiyoshi District|qq=|12=simple|13=User:Immanuelle/Sumiyoshi District|qq=}}: Ame no Mikumari Toyoura no Mikoto Shrine :''' Identified as: Enshrined within {{ill|Totoro-hime Shrine|ja|止止呂支比売命神社|qq=draft|12=simple|13=User:Immanuelle/Totoro-hime Shrine|qq=|12=simple|13=User:Immanuelle/Totoro-hime Shrine|qq=|12=simple|13=User:Immanuelle/Totoro-hime Shrine|qq=}} (Osaka, {{Coord|34|36|17.25|N|135|29|50.50|E|region:JP-27_type:landmark|name=Ame no Mikumari Toyoura no Mikoto Shrine}}) ; Kokushi Genzaisha :* [[:en:Aki Province|Aki Province]]: Mikumari Tenjin :''' Identified as: {{ill|Mikumari Shrine (Fuchu, Hiroshima)|ja|水分神社|qq=draft|12=simple|13=User:Immanuelle/Mikumari Shrine (Fuchu, Hiroshima)|qq=|12=simple|13=User:Immanuelle/Mikumari Shrine (Fuchu, Hiroshima)|qq=|12=simple|13=User:Immanuelle/Mikumari Shrine (Fuchu, Hiroshima)|qq=|ja_comment=jawiki link invalid}} ([[